 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "BETWEEN WORLDS"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "Luca has spent his entire life in an orphanage, feeling alone and misunderstood. But when a series of strange events unfold, he finds himself in a world far different from his own. As he uncovers secrets about his past and searches for the family he never knew, Luca is thrust into a thrilling adventure filled with unexpected challenges and mysterious foes. Embark on a journey of self-discovery, courage, and the pursuit of a destiny greater than anything Luca could have imagined."
  },
